      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-title",
      "text": "What if you were ten times stronger... but your bones weren't?",
      "file": "03-title.mp3",
      "align": "03-title.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.15,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.62,
      "hash": "21547cc92aa8f710",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-rule",
      "text": "Your muscles got ten times stronger. Your bones, your tendons, your skin... stayed exactly the same.",
      "file": "04-rule.mp3",
      "align": "04-rule.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.65,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.14,
      "hash": "0886797980c5e6d7",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-nuance",
      "text": "And that's a real problem. Normal muscles can already pull hard enough to break a bone. Your brain holds them back. Yours has to hold back ten times harder.",
      "file": "05-nuance.mp3",
      "align": "05-nuance.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.95,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 10.48,
      "hash": "49e700814e4b7a26",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-record",
      "text": "So you learn to lift slowly. Smoothly. And you beat the world record by three hundred kilos.",
      "file": "06-record.mp3",
      "align": "06-record.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.95,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 6.54,
      "hash": "a591dfd0308116d2",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-nick",
      "text": "They call you Glass Hercules.",
      "file": "07-nick.mp3",
      "align": "07-nick.align.json",
